<Base title="Privacy | Best Weight Loss Meds" description="What data Best Weight Loss Meds collects and why.">
  <section class="hero"><div class="wrap"><h1>Privacy</h1></div></section>
  <section class="section" style="padding-top:0">
    <div class="wrap prose">
      <p>This site doesn't use analytics, advertising or tracking cookies, and doesn't ask for any personal information.</p>
      <p>Our hosting provider keeps standard server logs (IP address, browser type, the pages requested and when) to keep the site running and secure. We don't use them for anything else.</p>
      <p>Links to providers take you to their own websites, which have their own privacy policies.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
